const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"从日内变化到每日波动",en:"From intraday movement to daily volatility"},body:{zh:"Andersen等人研究如何把日内信息用于日频及更低频的波动测量与预测。重点不是预测价格方向，而是把波动从潜在变量转为可以由高频收益近似测量的对象，再研究这个对象随时间如何变化。",en:"Andersen and coauthors use intraday information to measure and forecast daily and lower-frequency volatility. Their target is not price direction. They construct an observable proxy for variation from high-frequency returns, then model its dynamics."}},{title:{zh:"原始样本与时间切分",en:"Original observations and time split"},body:{zh:"原始材料是1986年12月至1999年6月Reuters屏幕上的马克/美元与日元/美元银行间买卖报价。它们是指示性报价，不是必然可成交的价格。作者剔除周末及部分低活跃假日后，保留3,045天，并将其分为2,449天估计期与596天样本外预测期。",en:"The raw material is indicative interbank DM/USD and JPY/USD bid/ask quotes on Reuters, December 1986–June 1999—not binding transaction prices. After weekend and selected holiday exclusions, 3,045 days remain: 2,449 for estimation and 596 for out-of-sample evaluation."},reference:{url:"https://users.ssc.wisc.edu/~behansen/718/Anderson2003.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第3.1节：报价、清理与样本切分",en:"Original §3.1: quotes, cleaning and sample split"}}},{title:{zh:"30分钟采样是取舍",en:"Thirty-minute sampling is a trade-off"},body:{zh:"作者从相邻报价插值得到等间隔价格，再计算30分钟对数收益；按日累加收益平方及交叉乘积，构造波动与协变动。选择30分钟，是为了平衡更密集采样的信息收益与微观结构噪声，并非证明这个间隔对所有市场最优。",en:"They interpolate prices from neighboring quotes, calculate half-hour log returns and aggregate squared returns and cross-products. Thirty-minute sampling balances information against microstructure contamination in this setting. It is not a universally optimal interval."},reference:{url:"https://users.ssc.wisc.edu/~behansen/718/Anderson2003.pdf",label:{zh:"原文第3.1–3.2节：收益与已实现波动构造",en:"Original §§3.1–3.2: returns and realized-volatility construction"}}},{title:{zh:"论文报告的发现",en:"What the paper reports"},body:{zh:"作者利用对数已实现波动的近似高斯分布与长记忆特征建立简单的多变量模型，并报告其波动预测通常优于比较模型。结合条件收益分布后，还检验密度与分位数预测。阅读时要分开点预测好坏和整个预测分布是否校准，不能用其中一个替代另一个。",en:"The authors exploit approximately Gaussian log realized volatility and long-memory dynamics in a simple multivariate model. They report generally strong volatility forecasts and assess return-density and quantile calibration. Point-forecast accuracy and distributional calibration are distinct evaluations."}},{title:{zh:"建议怎样读",en:"A useful reading order"},body:{zh:"先读第3节，明确每日样本究竟怎样生成；再回第2节理解二次变差与实际测量之间的关系；最后读第5–6节的模型与预测比较。尤其注意：已实现波动是事后测量，预测必须只使用预测时点之前的信息，二者不能混成同一个指标。",en:"Start with Section 3's construction, return to Section 2's quadratic-variation foundation, then read Sections 5–6 on modeling and forecast comparisons. Keep ex-post realized variation distinct from a forecast formed using information available beforehand."}},{title:{zh:"迁移到股票分钟线的缺口",en:"What changes with equity bars"},body:{zh:"编辑建议：股票有午间休市、集合竞价、停牌和隔夜区间，不能照搬全球外汇的24小时日界。分钟收盘价也不是原文的买卖报价中点。应先标明缺口与时间网格，单独处理隔夜变化，再讨论频率敏感性，不能将补零后的完整表格当作完整观测。",en:"Editorial application: equities introduce lunch breaks, auctions, suspensions and overnight intervals, unlike the global FX day. Minute closes are not quote midpoints. Mark gaps, define session boundaries and separate overnight movement before testing sampling sensitivity; zero-filled rows are not observations."}}],readerLimits:{zh:"历史外汇结果不能直接证明股票或加密市场的预测效果；缺失、报价口径与采样噪声都需要重新检查。",en:"Historical FX results do not establish forecasting performance for equities or crypto. Missingness, quote conventions and sampling noise require fresh checks."}};export{e as default};
